<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/completeness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Provides information about the completeness of relationships."@en .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Build/configSourceDigest> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Property that describes the digest of the build configuration file used to\ninvoke a build."@en .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/SupplyChain/HarvestAction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "HarvestAction represents the act of creating a product by directly extracting goods or materials from nature."@en .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/orcidid> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "[Open Researcher and Contributor ID (ORCID) iD](https://info.orcid.org/what-is-orcid/) is a unique identifier for authors and contributors in scholarly communication; as a subset of the International Standard Name Identifier (ISNI), it typically appears as a URI such as `https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1825-0097`."@en .
